        "4ce4d86ed195d881aca69b6b8d34aae5de9668e3"
      ],
      "title": "kdp: add expert info on illegal option length to prevent loop",
      "message": "kdp: add expert info on illegal option length to prevent loop\n\nIn KDP options, option_len includes the 1-byte option number and 1-byte length field, requiring option_len >= 2. An option length of 0 or 1 causes offset subtraction underflow (option_len - 2) and an infinite parsing loop.\n\nRegister and report ei_kdp_optionlen_bad when option_len < 2 on the option length item, then break out of the option loop.\n",
      "author_name": "Ayush Meel",
      "author_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-09-10T19:05:22.000+05:30",
      "committer_name": "meel-ayush",
      "committer_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
